---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="AI Adventure">
  <main class="page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Open adventures for AI</p>

      <h1>AI Adventure</h1>

      <p class="introduction">
        AI Adventure is an open format for interactive adventures powered by modern AI.
      </p>
    </header>

    <p>
      Choose an adventure, generate a launch prompt, and let your favourite AI
      become the storyteller.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a class="button" href="/adventures/">
        Browse Adventures
      </a>
    </p>

    <hr />

    <section>
      <h2>Play stories that aren't already written</h2>

      <p>
        AI Adventure gives the AI a world, characters, secrets and rules, but not
        a script. You decide what your character does, and the AI responds while
        keeping the adventure true to its underlying world.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="/documentation/">Create an Adventure →</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>